msgid ""
"The SBUS pin can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, "
"except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, "
"FPort, when connected in this manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"SBUS 引脚可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但需要真正 UART 连接的 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外。不过，FPort"
" 以这种方式连接时可以提供 RC，但没有数传。"

